% composition-bridge: Hear the offbeat accompaniment, horn conversation and buoyant ensemble precision.
% composition-context: The Skatalites are foundational to Jamaican ska and its links with mento, jazz, R&B and later reggae. This original classroom song uses offbeat rests as a comparison, not a ska claim.
% composition-distance: Original melody, lyric and I-V harmony; no horn riff, bass line or recording arrangement is copied.
